sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Trackers
    participant V as Volandoo Server
    participant L as Live Scoring App

    T->>V: Raw GPS points (~1/sec per pilot)
    V->>V: Buffer points in local cache

    loop Every 15 seconds
        V->>L: POST /mangas/mangaid/points<br/>{cutoff_epoch, points[]}
        L->>L: Dedupe by (pilot_id, timestamp)<br/>accept out-of-order entries
        L-->>V: 200 OK {received_cutoff_epoch}
        V->>V: Purge cache up to received_cutoff_epoch
        L->>L: Compute classification<br/>(may lag a few seconds)
        L->>V: {computed_at_epoch, ranking[]}
        V->>V: Publish ranking on public event page
        V->>L: POST /mangas/mangaid/classification/ack<br/>{acknowledged_epoch}  (proposed)
    end

    Note over V,L: On timeout or dropped ack, either side<br/>calls GET /mangas/mangaid/sync-status<br/>to compare last known epochs and resync.<br/>Duplicate/late points are harmless due to<br/>the (pilot_id, timestamp) uniqueness key.
